            "review_title": "Review at Cafe Tranh",
            "review_text": "mikecudgen\nKingscliff, Australia256 contributions\n0\nLow priced delicious food\nOct 2018 • Friends\nA small cafe on the main road. English speaking owner was very friendly and helpful. The beers were icy cold and the menu was quite extensive. Several friends had pizzas which they raved about, whilst others, myself included enjoyed traditional foods. Delicious! Prices were very reasonable, and great value. We will definitely return.\nWritten October 8, 2018",
